# Build context for packaging/docker/Dockerfile (the repository root): the sources the web build
# needs, without build output, git history or local files. The few small files that say which
# commit this is stay in, for the build id (apps/solidcraft-web/build.rs).
.git
!.git/HEAD
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/heads
**/target*
dist
plan
docs/screenshots
